  "answer_text": "Because Domino's deals are region-specific, the best voucher or coupon codes depend on where you are ordering from. \n\n---\n\n### **For US Customers (Coupons & Promo Codes)**\nIn the US, Domino\u2019s heavily relies on national value deals that are usually built directly into the website or app, but some codes can be entered manually:\n\n*   **The Mix & Match Deal ($6.99 each):** Get 2 or more eligible items (including Medium 2-topping pizzas, stuffed cheesy breads, pastas, sandwiches, salads, or desserts) for **$6.99 each**. \n    *   *Promo Code:* **9193** (if it doesn\u2019t apply automatically).\n*   **Text Discount (20% Off):** Get a **20% off** code sent to your phone by texting **PIZZA** to **366466**.\n*   **The Weeklong Carryout Deal ($7.99):** Pick up a Large 1-topping pizza, 8-piece wings, or Dips & Twists combo for **$7.99**. \n*   **Group Discount (20% Off):** If you are placing a large order of **10 or more pizzas**, you automatically qualify for **20% off**.\n*   **Check Local Coupons:** The most reliable way to find US codes is to go to the **Coupons** tab on [Dominos.com](https://www.dominos.com) and enter your ZIP code. This will reveal exclusive local BOGO offers, carryout specials, and percentage-off deals unique to your closest store.\n\n---\n\n### **For UK Customers (Voucher Codes)**\nIf you are ordering in the UK (where \"vouchers\" are most commonly used), you can try the following active codes and national deals:\n\n*   **50% Off Order (Minimum Spend):** Try the voucher code **DINEON50** at checkout to get 50% off your total order. \n*   **35% Off Orders Over \u00a340:** Use voucher code **KEYDDTPO** at checkout to save 35% on larger orders.\n*   **50% Student Discount:** If you are a student, you can unlock a **50% off** voucher (usually requiring a \u00a325 minimum spend) by logging into [Student Beans](https://www.studentbeans.com) or [UNiDAYS](https://www.myunidays.com).\n*   **50% NHS / Key Worker Discount:** Domino's offers NHS staff **50% off**. You can claim this by logging into your Blue Light Card account or presenting a valid ID for collection orders (depending on your local branch).\n*   **Two for Tuesday:** Every Tuesday, Domino's runs a national **Buy One Get One Free** offer on medium and large pizzas. No voucher code is required\u2014just add them to your basket on Tuesdays.\n*   **Price Slice Deal:** Pizzas starting from just **\u00a310**.\n\n### **How to Apply a Code:**\n1. Build your order on the Domino's website or mobile app.\n2. Head to the checkout/cart screen.\n3. Look for the box labeled **\"Have a coupon?\"** or **\"Have a voucher?\"**\n4. Enter the code and click **Apply/Submit** to see your discount reflected in the total.",
